        "text": "As of October 28, 2026, the first-party Claude API accepts Messages API requests up to 128 MB, and Token Counting API requests up to 128 MB as well. The previous ceiling was 32 MB, so the limit was raised four times over in a single release note. Exceeding it returns a 413 request_too_large error. The limit is measured on the request body, so base64-encoded image payloads count toward it at roughly one third more than their raw size."
